dheld label printer designed for professionals requiring durable and legible labels in various environments. Whether you're labeling cables, panels, or equipment, this device offers reliability and ease of use.</p><h3>Key Specifications</h3><ul><li>Display: 15-character x 1-line LCD screen</li><li>Keyboard: QWERTY layout for efficient typing</li><li>Compatible Tape Sizes: 3.5mm, 6mm, 9mm, 12mm</li><li>Tape Types: Standard Laminated, Flexible ID, Extra Strength Adhesive, Non-Laminated Iron-on Fabric, Acid-Free</li><li>Print Resolution: 180 dpi</li><li>Print Speed: Up to 20mm per second</li><li>Power Options: 6 AA batteries or optional AC adapter</li><li>Cutter: Manual</li><li>Dimensions: Approximately 4.3\" W x 8.0\" H x 2.2\" D</li><li>Weight: Approximately 0.7 kg​</li></ul><h3>Features</h3><ul><li>Multiple Fonts and Styles: Choose from 3 fonts (Helsinki, Brussels, US) and 10 styles including Normal, Bold, Outline, Shadow, Italic, and more.</li><li>Font Sizes: Options include Small, Medium, and Large to suit various labeling needs.</li><li>Built-in Symbols: Access to 253 symbols for enhanced label customization.</li><li>Vertical Printing: Supports vertical label printing for specific applications.</li><li>Auto Numbering: Automatically increments numbers from 1 to 10 on labels.</li><li>Memory Function: Stores up to 15 label designs for quick reuse.</li><li>Label Length Setting: Adjustable label length settings for precise labeling.</li><li>Multi-copy Printing: Print up to 9 copies of the same label.</li><li>Date/Time Stamp: Option to include date and time on labels.</li><li>Built-in Designs/Templates: Offers 17 Deco Mode Patterns and 9 Auto Designs for creative labeling.​</li></ul><p></p><h3>The PT-E115B is well-suited for:</h3><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\"><b>Electrical Installations:</b></span><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\"> Labeling wires, panels, and circuits.</span><p></p><p><b>Network Cabling: </b>Organizing and identifying network cables.</p><p><b>Industrial Maintenance: </b>Marking equipment and machinery.</p><p><b>Office Organization: </b>Labeling files, folders, and storage areas.</p>\n              </div>\n          </div>\n  </div>\n\n            </div>\n                                        <div class=\"module-item module-item-4 tab-pane\" id=\"blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-2\">\n                  <div class=\"block-body expand-block\">\n            <div class=\"block-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"block-content  block-dynamic\">\n                <div class=\"module-compatibility-table\" id=\"tab-compatibility\">\n            <h3>Product List</h3>\n        <div class=\"module-compatibility-table-content\">\n      \n        <div class=\"table-responsive\">\n          <table class=\"table table-bordered\">\n            <thead>\n                <tr>\n                  <td class=\"compatibility-table-name\"><strong></strong></td>\n                  <td class=\"compatibility-table-price\"><strong>Price</strong></td>\n                </tr>\n            </thead>\n            <tbody>\n                                <tr>    \n                    <td class=\"compatibility-table-name\"><a href=\"/%20otech-lt-110h-bluetooth-label-maker-with-qwerty-keyboard\">OTECH LT-110H Bluetooth Label Maker With QWERTY Keyboard</a></td>\n                    <td class=\"compatibility-table-price\">\n                        <p class=\"price\"> \n                                                            6,500৳\n                                                         \n                        </p>                      \n                    </td>\n                </tr>\n                    \n            </tbody>\n          </table>\n        </div>   \n    </div>\n            <div class=\"module-compatibility-table-footer text-center\">\n            <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-view-compare btn-primary\" id=\"compatibility-table-full\">View Details</button>\n        </div>    \n    </div>\n           \n\n              </div>\n   